# In short: every text file is checked out with LF line endings on every OS, as it is committed.
# The packs whose bytes a hash pins (songs' music2.lock files and packs/versions.toml name them) are
# never converted at all: a CRLF would change their hashes (PACK-17).
* text=auto eol=lf
packs/** -text
core/session/tests/fixtures/packs/** -text
e2e/fixtures/library/** -text
